President. The Left can defend the gain, call it a floor, or work for a
signature.?]
[? if not partnership_sejm_passed: The bill remains in Parliament. Lewica can
publish the dissenters, reopen a narrower bargain, or rebuild the equality
coalition rather than pretending a law exists.?]

