@snap_first_vote
title: First-attempt confidence
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const randomVotes = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 7
) - 3;
Q.snap_first_variance = randomVotes;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.snap_pm_candidate;
Q.confidence_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        Math.round(Number(Q.snap_pm_base) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.snap_left_transfer) || 0) +
            randomVotes
    )
);
Q.confidence_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460 - Q.confidence_yes,
        60,
        4 + (Number(Q.snap_left_abstentions) || 0)
    )
);
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(
    0,
    460 - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_abstain
);
Q.confidence_present = 460;
Q.confidence_threshold = 231;
Q.government_has_confidence = Q.confidence_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
Q.confidence_mode = "Post-snap presidential first attempt";
!}

= First confidence roll call

**[+ snap_pm_candidate +]: [+ confidence_yes +] yes · [+
confidence_no +] no · [+ confidence_abstain +] abstain**

Yes count: **[+ snap_pm_base +] nominee base** + **[+
snap_left_transfer +] Lewica transfers** + **[+ snap_first_variance +]
roll-call variance**. Threshold: **231**.

